message: "If you use this collection, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Welte-Mignon Advertisements Collection"
abstract: >-
  A TEI edition of print advertisements for the Welte-Mignon reproducing
  piano that appeared between 1905 and 1930: transcriptions with the layout
  of their originals, descriptions of all known printings, persons linked to
  the GND, and an annotation of recurring motifs (topics).
